posts.body:
@RCXGaming
So guys, I'm a newbie, and I thought I'd ask but if RCX is already judging me for that. I think it says more about him than it does about me. So please, man, back off. If you don't want to answer my question, no one is forcing you to. But judging my character based on what? A query for my first game? You're really showing who you are. It makes me wonder if I'll even play your games. Don't confuse humility with a lack of confidence; you really don't know me, and what you're doing is just spreading hate.
And my english is bad I hope you all understand what I am saying. Thank you for the answers guys.
